<title>USA: Hearing date set in Norfolk Southern suit.</title>
<headline>Hearing date set in Norfolk Southern suit.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. District Court Judge Donald Van Artsdalen on Thursday scheduled a hearing for November 12 into Norfolk Southern Corp's suit to block a proposed merger between Conrail Inc and CSX Corp, a court official said.</p>
<p>&quot;We have a hearing scheduled for November 12 at 9:00 am,&quot; the official of U.S. District Court for Eastern Pennsylvania said.</p>
<p>The hearing will be &quot;all outstanding motions&quot; in the case, he said.</p>
